sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR/Manager"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.holidays.index)"
    participant Controller as "Admin HolidayController"
    participant Model as "Holiday Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Buka menu Libur Nasional
    View->>Controller: GET /admin/holidays
    Controller->>Model: Filter tahun default / pilih tahun
    Model->>DB: SELECT holidays ORDER BY date
    DB-->>Model: Data libur nasional
    Model-->>Controller: Koleksi libur + daftar tahun

    alt Data valid (data berhasil diambil)
        Controller->>View: Render tabel libur nasional
        View-->>Admin: Daftar hari libur tampil
    else Data tidak valid (query error / data kosong tidak ter-handle)
        Controller->>View: Redirect/back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal memuat libur
    end
